{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54731","headline":"兵要望江南 占月第十二（京本列第七○二十三首） 十三 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占月第十二（京本列第七○二十三首） 十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"双月现，现则有兵荒。\n两两三三俱荒乱（辛本、川本、京本作「乱出」），当其现处有（辛本、川本、京本作「竞」）猖狂，人马两（京本作「死及」）逃亡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54731.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54731","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}